    "text": "By WJHG Newsroom ,\n11 hours ago PANAMA CITY, Fla. (WJHG/WECP) - In this episode of Chapter Chat, Donna Jones Alward takes us aboard the Titanic through her novel Ship of Dreams. From meticulous historical research to the overlooked realities of women’s lives at the time, we explore what the tragedy reveals about society, ambition, and the personal stories history can’t fully capture. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
